{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "act39side_level_act39side_04_end",
  "groupId": "act39side",
  "stageId": "act39side_04",
  "title": "Accidental Reunion",
  "storyCode": "EP-4",
  "avgTag": "After Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/activities/act39side/level_act39side_04_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "b6f08baca898dff6aceca78bfaca0cd912ec920e5fbd8f1c2f7ce9149134b31c",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elysium",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That's two arms, two legs, two eyes, two ears, one nose, all present and accounted for. Maybe a bit of a tan?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elysium",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Thank goodness! You have you no idea how anxious I was when I heard these bandits were stone-cold killers who ate people for breakfast!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Isidro",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And who told you THAT?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elysium",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Do you know how much courage I had to muster to come here and rescue you? Weedy's still back at town. I'll get in touch with her."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Isidro",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elysium",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(Whisper) Whenever you're ready, I'll call her, and we can get out of here!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Isidro",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I've tried, it's practically impossible. Besides, I don't plan on leaving for now."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elysium",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Why not? Don't tell me you actually joined up with these bandits like they say?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elysium",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(Whisper) Come on, out with it. Or do you really think there's a future out here with these backwater thugs?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Isidro",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...I have no interest in becoming a pirate, Elysium."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Isidro",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'm staying because... I want to resume the alchemical research I ran from. This compass has Corazonix in it, maybe the last one."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Isidro",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Besides... I promised them I would fix it. It's critical for their survival."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elysium",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "So... you plan to stay with them?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Isidro",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No. Once it's fixed, they'll leave the Salt Flat for the ocean."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Isidro",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Then I'll stay behind and continue to hone my skills in both swordplay and alchemy."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Elysium pats Isidro on the shoulder. His friend seems to have changed."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elysium",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Sounds like you've had a lot to think about... Well, that's not such a bad thing."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elysium",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "So what exactly did the girl outside want me to do here again?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Isidro",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I needed an assistant as I repair the compass."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elysium",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Just like back in Rhodes Island, then. Let me know what you need."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Isidro",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Mm-hm."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Isidro",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I will."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Isidro stands before the transmutation table. The probe in his hand makes a sharp sound as it swipes through the air, an Arts energy field forming along the lines that it draws.\nHe carefully removes the outer casing of the compass and places it on the table. The viscous substance inside begins to liquify, creating waves in the direction of the energy flow.\nArts energy and Corazonix intertwine into a golden light illuminating the salt flat outside through the gaps in the workshop walls.\nThe sailors have never seen anything like it. They begin to gather one by one."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Peeping Sailor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What are they doing in there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Curious Sailor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That kid from outside is doing his thing, that owl-kemmie or whatever... Never though it'd glow gold like that though."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Peeking Sailor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Lemmesee, lemmesee..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Isidro",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elysium",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Not gonna lie, this is pretty sick. What's that in your hand?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Curious Passerby",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What's that in his hand?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Scoffing Passerby",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Some beggar's magic trick, what else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Curious Passerby",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Oh. Well, nothing to see here then. It's not like we have any food to spare."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Scoffing Passerby",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Bothersome brat..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Isidro",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Come and see my trick! All I ask is a piece of bread—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Isidro",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Ugh..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aloof Passerby",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Get lost, you're in the way."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Isidro",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(Whisper) Bastard..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Isidro",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elysium",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Er, we're attracting quite a crowd outside. Does that bother you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elysium",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Want me to chase them away?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Isidro",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's fine. With you here chatting away, it feels like I'm right back at Rhodes Island. They won't bother me."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Isidro's hands do not stop. The probe in his hand seems to dance with the Corazonix rippling in the energy field.\nHis palms emit light, looking to the sailors peeping through the windows like a mirage born of hunger and thirst."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Peeping Sailor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You ever seen anything like it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Curious Sailor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Way back when, I remember the boss talking about folks who'd perform tricks for others in the big cities. Guess that's what it looks like?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Peeking Sailor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's beautiful..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Isidro",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Let them watch. Just make sure they don't barge in and try to sell me for food."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elysium",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...Sounds weirdly plausible. Do people do that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Isidro",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "People do a lot of things when there's nothing to eat."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shy Child",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Excuse me..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Isidro",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Do you have any food?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shy Child",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No... will you take this ribbon though?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Isidro",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No, it's got to be something I can eat."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shy Child",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I don't have anything to eat myself... I..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kind Passerby",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I happen to have a few biscuits here. Why don't you let this young lady see your trick?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Isidro",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Biscuits? Sure, since you asked."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Metal begins to flow in young Isidro's palm, glowing with fantastical colors in the darkness.\nPassersby cannot help but gather around. The disdain in their words cannot disguise the fact that their eyes are glued to the light in the young boy's hand.\nIt has been so long since there was something so bright on these streets."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shy Child",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's so pretty. Can I take a closer look?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Isidro",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Suit yourself."
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The boy waves his fingers, and the flowing metal turns into a fowlbeast that takes to the air before returning to his palm in the shape of a fin, then a musbeast, then a burdenbeast...\nThe metallic burdenbeast runs through the crowd, shiny and chrome, leaving behind stardust in the air."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Curious Passerby",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Wow!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Scoffing Passerby",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's just—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Curious Passerby",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Oh, shut up and watch."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aloof Passerby",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "When was the last time I saw fireworks..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aloof Passerby",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I think it was a long, long time ago..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shy Child",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Fireworks? What are fireworks?"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The child musters the courage to reach out and catch a burst of drifting starlight. She trembles at the warmth upon her fingertips."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kind Passerby",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Impressive, boy. It's not often that the people here have something to smile about."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Isidro",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Just trying to earn my bread."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kind Passerby",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Is that so?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kind Passerby",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Why do you have a smile on your face, then?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The probe guides the Corazonix, drawing a river of stars in the air.\nMore and more sailors gather, pressing their faces to the window, the thirst, hunger and exhaustion on their faces temporarily replaced by awe and wonder."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elysium",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Now you're just showing off."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elysium",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Did you think I couldn't tell?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Isidro",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Isidro",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That was just a check of the alchemy equipment and compass. Now comes the next step: separating the rusted and denatured parts from the Corazonix."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Isidro",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "This is what I promised them... what I can do for them."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pascuala",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You two sure spent a long time chatting."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elysium",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Well, it's been a while since we last saw each other. Were you sitting out here this whole time, boss?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pascuala",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You can stop calling me boss. All my friends call me Peludita, on account of how fluffy I am."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elysium",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Oh, so we're friends now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pascuala",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "'Course we are! Could you have ever found your old amigo without the help of yours truly?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elysium",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(Talk about twisting the truth.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elysium",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hm... so what should you call <i>me</i>, now that we're friends?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pascuala",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Anything you like! More importantly, what did Señor Isidro say?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pascuala",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "About, you know, putting me under his protection?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elysium",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Oh, I forgot to ask. But maybe I'll remember tomorrow, if you ask nicely."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pascuala",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Please, o honorable Señor Pelirrojito! The greatest, handsomest Liberi of all!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elysium",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Ooh, I like that. Keep it coming!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pascuala",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(You flipping finshit!)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pascuala",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(I'm yanking that red bit right out once I'm out of this mess!)"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elysium",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elysium",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Well, I guess I <i>do</i> owe you one for helping me find my good buddy..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Elysium pats the girl on the head. Her youthful, childlike exterior belies the maturity, even cruelty, lying beneath."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elysium",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You sure keep some choice company for a girl your age. Well, come find me if you ever squeeze yourself into something you can't squeeze out of."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elysium",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'm as kind-hearted as they come, after all!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
